Adopt fetches one existing issue through the configured Remote. A new
Backend Ticket starts accepted at Priority P2 with no Effort. Adoption records the current
Backend state without queuing a Mutation.
.PP
If the Backend identity belongs to an Item previously detached, Re-Adopt
binds that same Item again and takes the Backend's current Shared Fields.
It preserves Selection State and Plan membership, and keeps Priority and
Effort until the next Pull imports the Backend's. A Backend close
clears Work State; a Backend reopen clears an obsolete Closing Reason.
